  "solution": {
    "text": "In $\\left[\\mathrm{Cu}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_4\\right]^{+}$\n$\\mathrm{Cu}^{+2}$ is in a state of $d s p^2$ hybridization and shape of the complex is square planar. (One $e^{-}$is excited from $3 d$ to $4 p$ during complex formation)",
